    "title": "Louisville lands commitment from Ohio DE Munir Lewis - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jody Demling ,\n10 hours ago Jeff Brohm and staff stay hot on the recruiting trail. The Cardinals have landed another commitment, and this one is a defensive end from Ohio. Cleveland Brush High School edge rusher Munir Lewis has announced for the Cardinals, picking U of L over Michigan State, Virginia Tech, and Ohio State. He had a total of 21 offers. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 5",
